eenShot_2560_04.png", "id": "272553581650079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75404385_272553584983412_4655041319607554489_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IcK2wZRpiOgQ7kNvwH_BeJ3&_nc_oc=AdqWVdFLqOUU3vDZIUouAADj1GWdqnXwIcf5Wv-cad1grr0zs78ssQg3rFjJLm-YmpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSabgb60-OEhf-0RU3ge62xjycrwQccrUVnBZjDwuCJZA&oe=6B01BACB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_Cover_Image.png", "id": "519739662640094", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001667_519739665973427_5542869304180809156_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=m-E-RMT1LbMQ7kNvwF920Pz&_nc_oc=Adp5iwGMb-WRwFC08ynpI5WDkEgouEKSODQPikUt6BpjO4mSPCwuwRgIN8T7ykcZtck&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTUKLlQZtFBLZPxRGK-Tf7yGPWd3XAOX4H94bxc1Q3z1w&oe=6B01E95A"}, "display_name": "JoinXR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "The enterprise XR Remote Meeting platform, designed for collaborating with both people and 3D data. Join lets you create rich presentations and share them in real time.\n\n- Collaborate with colleagues and clients from around the world in holographic meetings. Lifelike avatars from a single selfie make you feel as if you are in the same room.\n\n- Use a simple on device workflow to create your own presentations, mixing documents, images and video alongside 3D design data.\n\n- Engage stakeholders, Collaborate across disciplines, Review designs in 3D and Accelerate training by rapidly sharing knowledge.\n\nNOTE : To use Join you will need to have a trial account created for your organisation, please register an account here \n\nhttps://join.fracturereality.io/\n\nand contact \n\njoin@fracturereality.io", "short_description": "The enterprise XR Remote Meeting platform, designed for collaborating with both people and 3D data. Join lets you create ric